      <title>Today in one minute - Saturday, November 7, 2026</title>
      <link>https://jacobpedd.github.io/daily-digest/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://jacobpedd.github.io/daily-digest/#today-2026-11-07</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 21:13:02 -0800</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Nebraska fired offensive coordinator Dana Holgorsen after a fourth straight loss, and an angry Matt Rhule handed play-calling to Glenn Thomas. The Chiefs ruled out three defensive players for Sunday against the Jets and are working the phones for a receiver before Tuesday's trade deadline. In San Francisco, Daniel Lurie's charter-measure sweep hands him more power at City Hall in the same week his office fired most of its Bloomberg-funded innovation team. Bay Area voters passed a roughly $1 billion-a-year tax to save BART and Muni. And in New York, Sweden's Andreas Almgren won his marathon debut in 2:06:01.</p><p>Quick survey: Which section should get more space tomorrow?<br/><a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%20survey%3A%20Chiefs">Chiefs</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%20survey%3A%20Nebraska">Nebraska</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%20survey%3A%20AI%20%26%20agents">AI &amp; agents</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%20survey%3A%20Running">Running</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%20survey%3A%20SF">SF</a></p>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>'Angry' Rhule fires OC Holgorsen as Nebraska's skid hits four</title>
      <link>https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50409703/angry-rhule-fires-oc-holgorsen-amid-nebraska-4-game-skid</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50409703/angry-rhule-fires-oc-holgorsen-amid-nebraska-4-game-skid</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 18:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Nebraska</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F1107%2Fr1742480_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg" alt="Nebraska football photo from ESPN's Holgorsen story" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Out less than a week after Rhule called him one of the best offensive minds of our generation. Glenn Thomas takes over play-calling for the final three games, starting with the fallout from Friday's 24-13 loss at Illinois.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Like so many of you, I am angry, I am disappointed and I am frustrated with our results this season.&rdquo; - <a href="https://apnews.com/article/nebraska-huskers-holgorsen-b04f098d5d62105ed636dbcbb85fe02c">Matt Rhule, Nebraska head coach, in a statement</a></blockquote>
<blockquote>&ldquo;While there are many areas that need improvement, our offensive plan and execution is simply not working.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.cbssports.com/college-football/news/nebraska-fires-dana-holgorsen-offensive-coordinator-matt-rhule/">Rhule, in the same statement</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50409703/angry-rhule-fires-oc-holgorsen-amid-nebraska-4-game-skid">ESPN</a> &middot; <a href="https://apnews.com/article/nebraska-huskers-holgorsen-b04f098d5d62105ed636dbcbb85fe02c">AP</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.cbssports.com/college-football/news/nebraska-fires-dana-holgorsen-offensive-coordinator-matt-rhule/">CBS Sports</a> &middot; <a href="https://nebraskapublicmedia.org/en/news/news-articles/dana-holgorsen-fired-as-nebraska-football-offensive-coordinator/">Nebraska Public Media</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.cbssports.com/college-football/news/illinois-tops-nebraska-24-13-to-secure-bowl-eligibility/">CBS Sports (game recap)</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%3A%20loved%20%22%27Angry%27%20Rhule%20fires%20OC%20Holgorsen%20as%20Neb...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%3A%20meh%20on%20%22%27Angry%27%20Rhule%20fires%20OC%20Holgorsen%20as%20Neb...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%3A%20less%20like%20%22%27Angry%27%20Rhule%20fires%20OC%20Holgorsen%20as%20Neb...%22">Less of this</a></p>]]></description>
      <media:content url="https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F1107%2Fr1742480_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg" medium="image"/>
    </item>
